cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DC-LINC: Operator-Aware Conclusion Decomposition for Neuro-Symbolic FOL Reasoning"
authors:
  - family-names: Rokni
    given-names: Nufel
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2025"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nufelroknidev/dc-linc"
abstract: >
  DC-LINC extends the LINC neuro-symbolic pipeline with operator-aware conclusion
  decomposition. A rule-based detector identifies the top-level logical connective,
  an LLM splits the conclusion into child sub-goals, Prover9 proves each child
  independently, and operator-specific three-valued merge rules aggregate the results.
  A simple fallback ensemble achieves 55.6% accuracy on the FOLIO operator subset,
  +13.9 pp over the LINC baseline.
